---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Vernacular Labs" description="Using AI to understand real people. Vernacular Labs conducts AI-led voice interviews at scale, producing population-representative estimates of what communities think and why.">

  
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="container-site pt-10 md:pt-16 pb-12 md:pb-20">
      <div class="relative rounded-[20px] overflow-hidden shadow-[0_30px_80px_-40px_rgba(30,20,10,0.5)]">
        <img
          src="/images/hero-waveform.jpg"
          alt="A double-exposure crowd of human figures forming a warm blue-to-red waveform"
          class="w-full h-[420px] md:h-[560px] lg:h-[640px] object-cover"
          fetchpriority="high"
        />
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-ink/55 via-ink/20 to-transparent"></div>
        <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-end">
          <div class="p-8 md:p-14 lg:p-20 text-cream max-w-3xl">
            <p class="eyebrow text-cream/80 mb-4">Vernacular Labs</p>
            <h1 class="font-serif text-[clamp(2rem,5vw,4.25rem)] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.02em] text-cream">
              Using AI to understand<br class="hidden sm:inline" />
              <span class="italic">real</span> people.
            </h1>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  
  <section class="container-site pb-6">
    <div class="grid gap-20 md:gap-28">

      
      <article class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 md:gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="md:col-span-6 order-2 md:order-1">
          <p class="eyebrow mb-3">What we do</p>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-[clamp(1.75rem,3.2vw,2.5rem)] leading-tight mb-5">
            AI voice agents that have real conversations &mdash; not surveys.
          </h2>
          <p class="prose-body mb-6">
            We build AI voice agents that call people on the phone and have real conversations &mdash;
            not surveys, not chatbots. These thousands of in-depth interviews feed into multilevel
            regression and poststratification (MRP) models that produce granular, representative
            estimates of what communities think and why.
          </p>
          <a href="/products" class="btn-ghost">How it works &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-6 order-1 md:order-2">
          <img
            src="/images/what-we-do-cafe.jpg"
            alt="Two people in conversation at a warm outdoor setting"
            class="w-full rounded-2xl shadow-[0_20px_60px_-30px_rgba(30,20,10,0.3)]"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </article>

      
      <article class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 md:gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="md:col-span-6">
          <img
            src="/images/why-it-matters-family.jpg"
            alt="A family outside their home in an everyday moment"
            class="w-full rounded-2xl shadow-[0_20px_60px_-30px_rgba(30,20,10,0.3)]"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-6">
          <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Why it matters</p>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-[clamp(1.75rem,3.2vw,2.5rem)] leading-tight mb-5">
            Real understanding begins with conversation.
          </h2>
          <p class="prose-body mb-6">
            In a divided world, traditional tools miss the nuance, emotion, and context behind
            what people believe. We use AI to listen at scale, with humility and care, turning
            voices into insight that reflects the full complexity of our communities.
          </p>
          <a href="/mission" class="btn-ghost">Our mission &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      
      <article class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 md:gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="md:col-span-6 order-2 md:order-1">
          <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Who we are</p>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-[clamp(1.75rem,3.2vw,2.5rem)] leading-tight mb-5">
            Built by researchers who have been doing this work for years.
          </h2>
          <p class="prose-body mb-6">
            Our team brings together doctoral-level expertise in statistical modeling, years of
            experience building national-scale political data infrastructure, and deep roots in
            Democratic campaigns and committees at every level.
          </p>
          <a href="/people" class="btn-ghost">Meet the team &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="md:col-span-6 order-1 md:order-2">
          <img
            src="/images/who-we-are-team.jpg"
            alt="A small, diverse team working together"
            class="w-full rounded-2xl shadow-[0_20px_60px_-30px_rgba(30,20,10,0.3)]"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>
  </section>

  
  <section class="container-site mt-24">
    <div class="rounded-3xl bg-ink text-cream p-10 md:p-16 text-center">
      <p class="eyebrow text-cream/70 mb-4">Get in touch</p>
      <h2 class="font-serif text-[clamp(1.75rem,3vw,2.5rem)] leading-tight mb-5 text-cream">
        Working on 2026 or 2028?<br/>
        <span class="text-clay">Let&rsquo;s talk.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="max-w-xl mx-auto text-cream/80 mb-8">
        We&rsquo;re running pilot projects with mission-aligned partners ahead of a broader launch.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-cream px-7 py-3 text-[15px] font-medium text-ink hover:bg-clay hover:text-cream transition-colors">
        Contact us
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
